<title>GERMANY: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZWIESEL, Germany 1997-01-18</dateline>
